data: {"id": "fc1e4e0f564f401d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1315", "run_id": "fc1e4e0f564f401d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（本轮工具结果）\n\n- **Pod 身份与当前状态**\n  - `aiops-case-v09/workload`，UID `5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305`，节点 `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.20`。\n  - Phase=Running，但 Container `app` 处于 `Waiting(CrashLoopBackOff)`，`Ready=False`；**重启次数=8**，消息为 `back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app`。\n  - Prometheus 基线指标印证：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason=CrashLoopBackOff)`、`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=8`、`kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason=Error`。\n\n- **崩溃前最后一次运行日", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789137117926, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

